# agentic-harness runtime (machine-specific or personal; never commit to a public template)
.harness/state.json
.harness/*.tmp
.harness/telemetry.log
.harness/daemon.pid
.harness/engine-probe.json
.harness/inbox/*
.harness/completed/*
.harness/failed/*
.harness/staging/*
.harness/worktrees/*
.harness/memory/sessions/*
.harness/memory/auto-lessons.md
# The folder/* form (instead of folder/) keeps each folder's .gitkeep, so the folders exist in the template.
!.harness/**/.gitkeep

# profile.md and lessons.md ARE committed (the template ships generic starter versions).
# In your own PUBLIC project, if they hold personal details, uncomment these two lines:
# .harness/memory/profile.md
# .harness/memory/lessons.md
